flowchart TB
  DEV[Development] --> REVIEW[Review and policy gates]
  REVIEW --> STAGE[Isolated staging]
  STAGE --> APPROVAL[Release approval]
  APPROVAL --> PROD[Future production boundary]
  REG[Artifact registry + provenance] --> STAGE
  REG --> PROD
  SEC[Secrets and identity controls] -. scoped config .-> STAGE
  SEC -. scoped config .-> PROD
  OBS[Redacted monitoring] -. signals .-> STAGE
  OBS -. signals .-> PROD
  ROLLBACK[Rollback / incident plan] -. control .-> PROD
